{"4228810": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fourteen Years of Flames", "steam_appid": 4228810, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About <i>Fourteen Years of Flames</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228810/extras/32e641512bb6f47216c309314369dde1.avif?t=1767172502\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228810/extras_big/32e641512bb6f47216c309314369dde1.webp?t=1767172502 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fenghuo Fourteen</i> is a story set against the backdrop of the fourteen years of war, offering players a chance to return to the battlefields of the War of Resistance Against Japanese Aggression from a Chinese perspective. Experience once again the smoke of war that engulfed 400 million people in those turbulent years, a time when the entire nation stood united in its struggle for survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Campaigns</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228810/extras/55c96da133d255745e39ba105c6e7e9f.poster.avif?t=1767172502\" width=852 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228810/extras/55c96da133d255745e39ba105c6e7e9f.webm?t=1767172502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228810/extras/55c96da133d255745e39ba105c6e7e9f.mp4?t=1767172502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fourteen Years of Flames</i> presents players with renowned historical battles. Your journey begins in the rugged terrain of Northeast China and leads to the ancient capital, Nanjing, as you participate in the massive national anti-invasion war that spanned across China. Experience the sorrow, sacrifice, and heroism unique to that era.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weapons and Equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228810/extras/967797d08a7dad860b7bfe7473be5e47.avif?t=1767172502\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228810/extras_big/967797d08a7dad860b7bfe7473be5e47.webp?t=1767172502 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fourteen Years of Flames</i> strives to faithfully recreate historical details, offering a 1:1 representation of the weapons, vehicles, and soldier gear used during the war. The game includes most of the weaponry and military equipment that appeared on the battlefields, from cold and hot weapons to various vehicles and gear.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Campaign Scenarios</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228810/extras/14e3a07d9f940cfee21917221358f147.poster.avif?t=1767172502\" width=854 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228810/extras/14e3a07d9f940cfee21917221358f147.webm?t=1767172502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Fourteen Years of Flames</i>, you will experience diverse and richly detailed campaign scenarios. The game aims to reveal the truth hidden behind the fog of history, bringing to life the solemn landscapes of China during the fourteen years of anti-invasion war. Each campaign offers a unique terrain and atmosphere, immersing players in the full intensity of the conflict.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Looking Back at History, We Wish Our Motherland Remains Unshaken for All Eternity.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228810/extras/ac0e68646093f047b53b06cb3907c9ce.poster.avif?t=1767172502\" width=856 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228810/extras/ac0e68646093f047b53b06cb3907c9ce.webm?t=1767172502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228810/extras/ac0e68646093f047b53b06cb3907c9ce.mp4?t=1767172502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2025 marks the 80th anniversary of China's victory in the War of Resistance Against Japanese Aggression. We wish for the world to enjoy peace and tranquility, for the people to live in prosperity, and for the future to always hold hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Justice prevails! Peace prevails! The people prevail!</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About <i>Fourteen Years of Flames</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228810/extras/32e641512bb6f47216c309314369dde1.avif?t=1767172502\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228810/extras_big/32e641512bb6f47216c309314369dde1.webp?t=1767172502 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fenghuo Fourteen</i> is a story set against the backdrop of the fourteen years of war, offering players a chance to return to the battlefields of the War of Resistance Against Japanese Aggression from a Chinese perspective. Experience once again the smoke of war that engulfed 400 million people in those turbulent years, a time when the entire nation stood united in its struggle for survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Campaigns</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228810/extras/55c96da133d255745e39ba105c6e7e9f.poster.avif?t=1767172502\" width=852 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228810/extras/55c96da133d255745e39ba105c6e7e9f.webm?t=1767172502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228810/extras/55c96da133d255745e39ba105c6e7e9f.mp4?t=1767172502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fourteen Years of Flames</i> presents players with renowned historical battles. Your journey begins in the rugged terrain of Northeast China and leads to the ancient capital, Nanjing, as you participate in the massive national anti-invasion war that spanned across China. Experience the sorrow, sacrifice, and heroism unique to that era.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weapons and Equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228810/extras/967797d08a7dad860b7bfe7473be5e47.avif?t=1767172502\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228810/extras_big/967797d08a7dad860b7bfe7473be5e47.webp?t=1767172502 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fourteen Years of Flames</i> strives to faithfully recreate historical details, offering a 1:1 representation of the weapons, vehicles, and soldier gear used during the war. The game includes most of the weaponry and military equipment that appeared on the battlefields, from cold and hot weapons to various vehicles and gear.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Campaign Scenarios</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228810/extras/14e3a07d9f940cfee21917221358f147.poster.avif?t=1767172502\" width=854 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228810/extras/14e3a07d9f940cfee21917221358f147.webm?t=1767172502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Fourteen Years of Flames</i>, you will experience diverse and richly detailed campaign scenarios. The game aims to reveal the truth hidden behind the fog of history, bringing to life the solemn landscapes of China during the fourteen years of anti-invasion war. Each campaign offers a unique terrain and atmosphere, immersing players in the full intensity of the conflict.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Looking Back at History, We Wish Our Motherland Remains Unshaken for All Eternity.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228810/extras/ac0e68646093f047b53b06cb3907c9ce.poster.avif?t=1767172502\" width=856 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228810/extras/ac0e68646093f047b53b06cb3907c9ce.webm?t=1767172502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228810/extras/ac0e68646093f047b53b06cb3907c9ce.mp4?t=1767172502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2025 marks the 80th anniversary of China's victory in the War of Resistance Against Japanese Aggression. We wish for the world to enjoy peace and tranquility, for the people to live in prosperity, and for the future to always hold hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Justice prevails! Peace prevails! The people prevail!</strong></p>", "short_description": "Fourteen Years of Flames is a story-driven FPS that replays China’s struggle in the Second Sino-Japanese War (1931–1945). Players embody 7 key characters and battle through 16 real historical events, experiencing the hardships and sacrifices over 14 years of struggle. Land weeps in 14 years of war.", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*</strong>, English<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228810/ee3de5792410bc59265bbc41a14841215642815d/header.jpg?t=1767172502", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228810/a44bdae3c95c47f33b6dbbfab87699e4d2f37c81/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767172502", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228810/a44bdae3c95c47f33b6dbbfab87699e4d2f37c81/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767172502", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> Not supported</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> Not supported</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</str